[I] GStreamer FFmpeg Plug-in

[T] GStreamer FFmpeg plug-in contains one plugin with a set of elements
[T] using the FFmpeg library code. It contains most popular decoders as
[T] well as very fast colorspace conversion elements.

[U] https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/

